OL,3,GNEWSAWidower's pride after wife's
OL,4,Aorgans save lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA husband has told of his pride after
OL,7,Fhis wife's donated organs saved the
OL,8,Flives of three people after her death.
OL,10,FMaureen Thompson, who ran a sweetshop
OL,11,Fin Hull for 26 years, died in April
OL,12,Flast year, just weeks before her 65th
OL,13,Fbirthday.
OL,15,FHer husband John, 67, said she had
OL,16,Falways been determined she should be an
OL,17,Forgan donor because there was "no
OL,18,Freason not to".
OL,20,F"Purely and simply, she would say it
OL,21,Fwould be a waste when it's useful," he
OL,22,Fsaid.
